                    },
                    "message": "Issue #5: Documentation could be more descriptive\n\n# Current code \n\n[Documentation]  Toggle SSH state and verify connectivity via IPv4 and/or IPv6.\n[Arguments]  ${ssh_action}  ${ip_protocol}=both\n\n\nFix: Add more detail about the keyword's behavior:\n\n[Documentation]  Toggle SSH state on the policies page and verify connectivity via specified IP protocol(s).\n...              Supports enabling or disabling SSH and testing via IPv4, IPv6, or both protocols.\n...              Automatically skips link-local addresses and unreachable IPs.\n[Arguments]  ${ssh_action}  ${ip_protocol}=both\n\n\nWhy: More detailed documentation helps future maintainers understand the keyword's full capabilities and behavior."
