                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Issue #1: Missing validation before list access\nLocation: gui/gui_test/settings_menu/test_network_sub_menu.robot\n\n# Current code\n${ipv4_list}=  Collect All IP Addresses On Both Interfaces  ipv4  ${channel}\nVerify SSH Connectivity  ${ipv4_list}  ${ssh_action}  169.254\n\nIssue: The code doesn't validate that ${ipv4_list} contains elements before passing it to Verify SSH Connectivity. If no IPv4 addresses are found, the FOR loop in Verify SSH Connectivity will silently skip without any indication.\n\nFix Required:\n\n${ipv4_list}=  Collect All IP Addresses On Both Interfaces  ipv4  ${channel}\n${list_length}=  Get Length  ${ipv4_list}\nIF  ${list_length} > 0\n    Verify SSH Connectivity  ${ipv4_list}  ${ssh_action}  169.254\nELSE\n    Log  No IPv4 addresses found on channel ${channel}  level=WARN\nEND\n\n\nWhy: Ensures test provides clear feedback when no IP addresses are available, making test failures easier to diagnose"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/settings_menu/test_network_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 2019,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Feroz M A",
                        "email": "m.a.feroz@ibm.com",
                        "username": "maferoz7"
                    },
                    "message": "Done"
                },
                {
                    "file": "gui/gui_test/settings_menu/test_network_sub_menu.robot",
                    "line": 2024,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "George Keishing",
                        "email": "gkeishin@gmail.com",
                        "username": "gkeishin"
                    },
                    "message": "Issue #4: Magic string '169.254' and 'fe80' could be constants\nLocation: gui/gui_test/settings_menu/test_network_sub_menu.robot\n\n# Current code\nVerify SSH Connectivity  ${ipv4_list}  ${ssh_action}  169.254\nVerify SSH Connectivity  ${ipv6_list}  ${ssh_action}  fe80\nFix: Define as constants in Variables section:\n\n*** Variables ***\n${IPV4_LINK_LOCAL_PREFIX}    169.254\n${IPV6_LINK_LOCAL_PREFIX}    fe80\n\nWhy: Improves code readability and makes the intent of skipping link-local addresses more explicit."
                },
                {
